models.description:
Stores authenticated user accounts with email and password hash for login authentication. This is the primary actor table representing a user identity with its own authentication flow. All user data is completely private - no access to other users' data is allowed. This table is referenced by session and password reset tables but contains no relationships to todos, profiles, or any other user-specific data. The display name is managed separately in todo_app_profiles table.

@link todo_app_user_sessions
@link todo_app_user_password_resets

Audit log of all display name changes for each user. Records timestamp, original display name, and new display name. Each entry is linked to a user via user_id and maintained for history tracking. This table is append-only and immutable - edit history entries are never updated or deleted. Used for compliance and accountability.

@link todo_app_users.id: Reference to the user who made the display name change.
@link todo_app_profiles.id: Represents the profile whose display name was changed.
